          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "地震相分类业务问题",
          "html": "<p>相带边界靠经验划定，同一区块不同人划出的相带数可差一倍；少量井标定要外推到整个数据体，主观性被放大。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"异组样品特征分布\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" fill=\"#274746\"><path d=\"M112 258H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.02</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"112\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.0</text><path d=\"M112 205.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"210.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.26</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"251.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.3</text><path d=\"M112 153H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.50</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"391\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.5</text><path d=\"M112 100.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"105.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.74</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"530.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.7</text><path d=\"M112 48H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.98</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"670\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">1.0</text><circle cx=\"535.67\" cy=\"62.16\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"599.35\" cy=\"80.96\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"572.73\" cy=\"48.00\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"653.48\" cy=\"82.53\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"565.10\" cy=\"60.26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"583.68\" cy=\"73.38\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"562.98\" cy=\"58.39\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"569.93\" cy=\"62.56\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"569.52\" cy=\"86.59\